AUDIO: 'fill in based on where you want the results to be sent. So, at this point we created {slash} session analysis, {slash} improve memory, and {slash} send result skills. Now, we have to take these three skills and package them all together into the orchestration skill,'

[12:57] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
