VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'iteration. I then add an argument for mode, which has one mode for full analysis and another for apply fixes. I\'ll dive into why a little bit more when we automate this actual skill. And then third, in the skill itself, you\'ll see that I reference each of the skills'

[13:21] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
